@startuml Sprint1_ERD

!theme plain

skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam entity {
    BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
    BorderColor #1976D2
}

title Sprint 1: Authentication & Basic User/Profile Management
note as N1
  Duration: 09 Oct 2025 - 19 Oct 2025
  User Stories: #1, #2, #3, #6, #8, #11, #13, #14, #24, #25, #33, #34
  Focus: Core authentication and basic CRUD operations
end note

' ====================
' CORE ENTITIES
' ====================

entity UserProfile {
    * id : UUID <<PK>>
    --
    * name : VARCHAR(100) <<UNIQUE>>
    description : TEXT
    permissions : JSON
    * isActive : BOOLEAN
    * createdAt : TIMESTAMP
    * updatedAt : TIMESTAMP
    --
    <<Static 4 Records Only>>
}

entity UserAccount {
    * id : UUID <<PK>>
    --
    * email : VARCHAR(255) <<UNIQUE>>
    * password : VARCHAR(255)
    * name : VARCHAR(255)
    phoneNumber : VARCHAR(20)
    address : TEXT
    dateOfBirth : DATE
    * status : UserStatus
    * userProfileId : UUID <<FK>>
    * createdAt : TIMESTAMP
    * updatedAt : TIMESTAMP
    --
    ' PIN-specific fields (nullable)
    age : INTEGER
    location : VARCHAR(255)
    accessibilityNeeds : TEXT
    profilePhoto : VARCHAR(500)
    --
    ' CSR Rep-specific fields (nullable)
    companyName : VARCHAR(255)
    companyRegistrationNumber : VARCHAR(100) <<UNIQUE>>
    industry : VARCHAR(100)
    contactPerson : VARCHAR(255)
    companyAddress : TEXT
    companyLogo : VARCHAR(500)
    --
    ' Platform Manager-specific fields (nullable)
    department : VARCHAR(100)
    --
    * profileStatus : ProfileStatus
}

' ====================
' RELATIONSHIPS
' ====================

' UserProfile <-> UserAccount (1:M)
UserProfile ||--o{ UserAccount : "has role"

' ====================
' NOTES
' ====================

note bottom of UserProfile
  **Only 4 static records exist:**
  1. PIN (Person-In-Need)
  2. CSR_REP (CSR Representative)
  3. USER_ADMIN (User Administrator)
  4. PLATFORM_MANAGER (Platform Manager)
  
  These are reference data, not user-created.
end note

note bottom of UserAccount
  **Single Table Inheritance Pattern**
  
  All user types stored in ONE table:
  - Role determined by userProfileId FK
  - Role-specific fields are nullable
  - Each user only uses fields relevant to their role
  
  **Sprint 1 Capabilities:**
  - Login/Logout (all roles)
  - Create user accounts
  - Suspend user accounts
  - Create user profiles
  - Suspend user profiles
end note

@enduml
